{"attempt":1,"diagnostics":[],"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","feedback":["CRITIC DIAGNOSTIC REPAIR: Retain the negative capability report for O8 and all active frozen IDs. The precise missing primitive is a registered predicate referring to the actual reconstructed contract metadata, its independent checks before proof, after acceptance and at closure, and the configured trust boundary. An alternative using records of IDs and flags plus list operations can encode stipulated metadata, but cannot bind those records to the actual contract or verification stages; equality of such constants does not establish O8. Source requirements can express the requested solve endpoint and seven closed properties, and folds can express the aggregation, but neither supplies the missing workflow predicates. The raw Lean alternative remains subject to the same executable DSL acceptance gates and supplies no registered primitive here. No faithful complete alternative is established; preserve the blocking report without claiming a fix or an implementation counterexample."],"milestone_authority":false,"phase":"formalize","results":[{"agent":"critic","attempted_checks":[],"checked":null,"instance":"critic/formalize/1/R0/group-1/critic/1","proposal":{"corrections":[{"artifact":"formalization.json","diagnostic_index":0,"explanation":"Retain the negative capability report for O8 and all active frozen IDs. The precise missing primitive is a registered predicate referring to the actual reconstructed contract metadata, its independent checks before proof, after acceptance and at closure, and the configured trust boundary. An alternative using records of IDs and flags plus list operations can encode stipulated metadata, but cannot bind those records to the actual contract or verification stages; equality of such constants does not establish O8. Source requirements can express the requested solve endpoint and seven closed properties, and folds can express the aggregation, but neither